item_assets/steam/apps/3587010/extras/a97968ad1ca8b87356719b6396c54b59.mp4?t=1757337228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a vibrant, colorful design and intuitive controls, Dice Battle supports both single-player and multiplayer modes, allowing you to play against AI opponents or challenge friends. The game follows traditional Ludo-style mechanics, where players move their pieces around the board based on dice rolls, aiming to reach the goal before their opponents. Tactical choices, lucky rolls, and unpredictable twists make every match unique. Whether you're looking for a quick game or an intense battle, Dice Battle offers endless fun for players of all ages.</p>","developers":["Hard Shark Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587010/2a73f2dcfd7c9bb7e77cc2b65a93d4523c3da5a3/header.jpg?t=1757337228","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Hard Shark Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3587010/848251/a17d36072bc99cb243cb96a60dd08ab750532d6d/1750462498/dash_av1.mpd?t=1742926460","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3587010/848251/a17d36072bc99cb243cb96a60dd08ab750532d6d/1750462498/dash_h264.mpd?t=1742926460","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3587010/848251/a17d36072bc99cb243cb96a60dd08ab750532d6d/1750462498/hls_264_maste